  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.1.title": "Survey Day I",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.1.body.1": "We landed on a pale ridge. The stone is dry as bone, yet each strike returns a hollow echo.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.1.body.2": "Camp is in a sheltered hollow. There is no wind here, but the tent cloth keeps moving.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.2.title": "The Answering Vein",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.2.body.1": "Purple shards run through the deep wall. Strike once and something beyond the rock answers twice.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.2.body.2": "They are cold, but pull iron dust toward the void. I sealed the deepest tunnel.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.3.title": "Obsidian Marks",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.3.body.1": "The distant pillars seem to move each night. Compasses spin, and shadows give no direction.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.3.body.2": "I drew the three tallest pillars. This morning, the drawing had a fourth.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.4.title": "Rules of Watching",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.4.body.1": "Endermen avoid bare shards but gather outside the sealed shaft. Never meet their eyes—or look where they look.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.4.body.2": "Last night one stood inside camp, holding our trail marker.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.5.title": "One Man Missing",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.5.body.1": "Edrin is gone. His prints cross the mine and end one step beyond the island edge. No return trail. No struggle.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.5.body.2": "Water lasts two days. Behind the sealed wall, he whistles our recall: three short, one long.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.6.title": "Final Entry",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.6.body.1": "The shards say my name now. Violet light leaks through the seal and reveals footprints that are not ours.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.miner_log.page.6.body.2": "Take the maps, not the ore. Whoever calls from ahead, do not follow the purple light.",

  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.1.title": "The Gatehouse",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.1.body.1": "Rain stopped three days ago, yet the gatehouse still drips. The air tastes like a rusted key.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.1.body.2": "I slept on dry cloth and woke with it floating beside the bed. Water is rising from the walls.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.2.title": "The Empty Patrol",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.2.body.1": "After midnight, iron boots cross the east hall every forty breaths. The armor walking through the water is empty.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.2.body.2": "It never turns, but its reflection always faces me. Tonight the steps stopped outside my door.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.3.title": "Four Flames",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.3.body.1": "Four lamps are carved beside the broken brazier. Three are crossed out; the fourth is blackened.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.3.body.2": "The guard said to light them from the end. When I did, chains moved below us.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.4.title": "The Western Crest",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.4.body.1": "The twin-serpent crest is missing a corner. Pressing it back opened an empty key box behind the relief.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.4.body.2": "Its base reads: third drain. The same mark appears on the map fragment.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.5.title": "The Drowned Chapel",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.5.body.1": "There is no idol below the water, only an altar door descending deeper. Slow breathing comes through its seam.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.5.body.2": "The map calls it foundation, but every corridor bends away from it.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.6.title": "Sealing Record",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.6.body.1": "I blocked the south stair with our last stone. Scratching continues in the wall, and the patrol now walks by day.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.damp_diary.page.6.body.2": "The key lies under the third drain. Leave it there. Do not drain the chapel. Do not open the altar.",

  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_1.page.1.title": "North Cistern Watch",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_1.page.1.body.1": "The empty armor passes the north cistern every forty breaths. After the third bell it stops at the broken crest.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_1.page.1.body.2": "Margin: its reflection turns before the armor does.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_2.page.1.title": "The Key Box",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_2.page.1.body.1": "The lead copy broke in the lock. The true key was moved from the western box to the third drain.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_2.page.1.body.2": "Cast no more. The lock hears echoes in the metal.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_3.page.1.title": "Drain Sequence",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_3.page.1.body.1": "Lower the north pool, then light three old lamps in reverse: west, east, south. Stop at the crest's lower edge.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_3.page.1.body.2": "Never light the fourth. It is not a lamp. It is a bolt.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_4.page.1.title": "On the Patrols",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_4.page.1.body.1": "There are no bodies in the armor. They are echoes of the old ward, repeating the route of its final night.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_4.page.1.body.2": "While the echoes still patrol, the thing beneath the altar is not fully awake.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_5.page.1.title": "Do Not Finish the Map",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_5.page.1.body.1": "Five corners point to a sealed stair below the third drain. Someone behind it now prays in my voice.",
  "gui.until_eternity.lore_book.torn_paper_5.page.1.body.2": "Burn the map. Throw the key back into the water. Stop here.",

